Procedure add takes left as integer right as integer returns integer: Return left plus right. End procedure. Say Call add with 4 5 done. Procedure scale takes value as float returns float: Return value times 2. End procedure. Say Call scale with 1.5 done. Procedure bump takes where as pointer to integer returns void: Set value at where to Value at where plus 1. Return. End procedure. Declare x as integer with value 9. Call bump with Address of x done. Say x. Procedure identity takes where as pointer to integer returns pointer to integer: Return where. End procedure. Declare p as pointer to integer with value Call identity with Address of x done. Say Value at p. Procedure first takes n as integer returns integer: Return Call second with n done. End procedure. Procedure second takes n as integer returns integer: Return n plus 1. End procedure. Say Call first with 4 done. Procedure sumfirst takes values as array of integer with length 2 returns integer: Return Element at 0 in values plus Element at 1 in values. End procedure. Declare pair as array of integer with length 2. Set element at 0 in pair to 7. Set element at 1 in pair to 8. Say Call sumfirst with pair done.
